            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
                <div>
                    <label style="font-size: 0.65rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #666; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">Heir Name *</label>
